      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "playfulness",
      "label": "playful howling expression",
      "description": "The dog's posture—head tilted back, mouth open, eyes closed—is exaggerated to convey a humorous, almost theatrical howl, suggesting playful or comical vocalization rather than genuine distress or emotion. The text 'Goooooooooooooon!!!!' further amplifies this by stretching the sound for comedic effect, indicating the emotion is meant to be lighthearted and amusing.",
